01:26:46,244 --> 01:26:49,421
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA-LA,
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA ♪

1511
01:26:49,552 --> 01:26:53,512
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA-LA,
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA ♪

1512
01:26:55,906 --> 01:26:59,126
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA-LA,
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA-LA ♪

1513
01:26:59,257 --> 01:27:02,782
♪ LA-LA-LA-LA-LA
LA-LA-LA-LA-LA ♪

