OF NICE THINGS TO WEAR ♪

1524
01:27:30,114 --> 01:27:31,594
I'M GONNA WALK OVER.

1525
01:27:34,336 --> 01:27:36,076
I'LL MEET YOU THERE.

1526
01:27:36,207 --> 01:27:42,387
♪ OOH, BABY, BABY,
