OH!

1537
01:28:19,119 --> 01:28:20,295
[ breathing heavily ]

1538
01:28:21,339 --> 01:28:23,733
OH, MACON!

1539
01:28:23,863 --> 01:28:27,258
♪ AND BEWARE

1540
01:28:27,389 --> 01:28:35,005
♪ WELL, OOH, BABY, BABY,
