1554
01:29:58,654 --> 01:30:01,178
FROM THIS DAY FORWARD,
FOR RICHER OR FOR POORER,

1555
01:30:01,308 --> 01:30:03,702
IN SICKNESS AND IN HEALTH,

1556
01:30:03,833 --> 01:30:06,357
FORSAKING ALL OTHERS
AS LONG AS YOU BOTH SHALL LIVE?

1557
01:30:06,488 --> 01:30:08,881
[ loudly ]
I DO.

1558
01:30:09,012 --> 01:30:10,840
AND DO YOU, ASHLEY,

1559
01:30:10,970 --> 01:30:12,972
PROMISE TO LOVE,
HONOR, AND CHERISH LEWIS,

1560
01:30:13,103 --> 01:30:14,844
FOR RICHER OR FOR POORER,

1561
01:30:14,974 --> 01:30:16,454
IN SICKNESS AND IN HEALTH,

1562
01:30:16,585 --> 01:30:19,283
FORSAKING ALL OTHERS
AS LONG AS YOU BOTH SHALL LIVE?

1563
01:30:19,414 --> 01:30:20,502
I DO.

1564
01:30:20,632 --> 01:30:22,112
THE RINGS?

1565
01:30:29,815 --> 01:30:31,164
DEAR FRIENDS,

1566
01:30:31,295 --> 01:30:33,645
LET US ASK GOD
TO BLESS THESE RINGS

1567
01:30:33,776 --> 01:30:37,127
AS A SYMBOL
OF THEIR LOVE EVERLASTING.

1568
01:30:37,257 --> 01:30:38,607
Lewis: NO. NO,
THE OTHER FINGER.

1569
01:30:38,737 --> 01:30:39,869
THAT'S RIGHT.

1570
01:30:39,999 --> 01:30:41,000
ASHLEY, LEWIS...

1571
01:30:41,131 --> 01:30:42,567
