She's having the baby.

1572
01:30:42,698 --> 01:30:44,874
Shh.
Please be quiet.

1573
01:30:45,004 --> 01:30:47,746
...AND HONOR TO DECLARE YOU
HUSBAND AND WIFE.

1574
01:30:47,877 --> 01:30:50,053
YOU MAY NOW KISS THE BRIDE.

1575
01:30:50,183 --> 01:30:52,969
[ applause ]

1576
01:30:56,451 --> 01:30:58,496
She's having
the baby...now.

1577
01:30:58,627 --> 01:31:00,280
Right now?

1578
01:31:00,411 --> 01:31:02,761
Scarlett's having the baby
right now. I have to go.

1579
01:31:02,892 --> 01:31:04,415
I'M SORRY. I'M SORRY.

1580
01:31:04,546 --> 01:31:06,199
SCARLETT'S HAVING
THE BABY.

1581
01:31:30,659 --> 01:31:32,008
BREATHE, BREATHE, BREATHE.

1582
01:31:33,400 --> 01:31:36,447
WAIT, WAIT, WAIT!
NO! NO!

1583
01:31:38,057 --> 01:31:39,624
SHIT!

1584
01:31:39,755 --> 01:31:41,278
OH, FOR HEAVEN'S SAKE.

1585
01:31:41,408 --> 01:31:43,193
IT'S OKAY.
IT'S OKAY.

1586
01:31:43,323 --> 01:31:44,673
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE THE BABY!

1587
01:31:44,803 --> 01:31:46,631
YOU'RE GONNA HAVE THE BABY!

1588
01:31:46,762 --> 01:31:47,589
LEWIS--

1589
01:31:47,719 --> 01:31:48,633
THANK YOU SO MUCH.

1590
01:31:48,764 --> 01:31:50,113
YOU HAVE GOT
TO DO SOMETHING.

1591
01:31:50,243 --> 01:31:52,376
THAT WAS JUST
A DREADFUL SCENE IN THERE.

1592
01:31:52,507 --> 01:31:54,944
NOW THE SEATING ARRANGEMENT'S
GONNA BE A DISASTER.

1593
01:31:55,074 --> 01:31:57,294
ONE EMPTY SEAT
