1594
01:31:57,424 --> 01:31:59,688
MOTHER, STOP IT. OKAY?

1595
01:32:02,038 --> 01:32:03,996
IT DOESN'T GET
ANY BETTER THAN THIS.

1596
01:32:06,564 --> 01:32:08,087
Halley: SQUEEZE MY HAND.
SQUEEZE MY HAND.

1597
01:32:08,218 --> 01:32:09,915
IT'S OKAY.
WE'RE GONNA GET THERE.

1598
01:32:10,046 --> 01:32:12,701
[ screams ]

1599
01:32:16,531 --> 01:32:18,924
I ASSUME DADDY WOULD LIKE
TO BE IN THE DELIVERY ROOM?

1600
01:32:19,055 --> 01:32:20,926
UH, ME?
NO, NO. I--

1601
01:32:21,057 --> 01:32:21,971
BABY!

1602
01:32:22,101 --> 01:32:23,015
MOMMY!

1603
01:32:23,146 --> 01:32:24,930
SWEETIE!
HI, SWEETIE.

1604
01:32:25,061 --> 01:32:26,279
MOMMY, I NEED YOU.

1605
01:32:26,410 --> 01:32:27,629
I'M HER MOTHER.

1606
01:32:27,759 --> 01:32:28,804
MISS SMITH?

1607
01:32:28,934 --> 01:32:30,545
IT'S OKAY.
OH, THANK YOU. THANK YOU.

1608
01:32:30,675 --> 01:32:32,024
DON'T LEAVE ME.

1609
01:32:52,001 --> 01:32:53,568
SO, DO YOU HATE ME?

1610
01:32:56,788 --> 01:32:59,138
NOT YOU, PER SE.

1611
01:33:03,534 --> 01:33:05,797
I HATE THE WAY YOUR HAIR
FALLS IN YOUR FACE.

1612
01:33:08,800 --> 01:33:10,367
AND I HATE
THE WAY YOUR VOICE

1613
01:33:10,497 --> 01:33:12,935
GETS REALLY LOW
WHEN YOU'RE SERIOUS.

1614
01:33:14,676 --> 01:33:16,982
AND I HATE THE WAY
YOU BITE YOUR BOTTOM LIP

1615
01:33:17,113 --> 01:33:18,723
WHEN YOU'RE NERVOUS.

1616
01:33:20,203 --> 01:33:23,119
AND THE WAY YOUR EYEBROW
GOES--[ whistles ]--LIKE THAT.

1617
01:33:24,381 --> 01:33:25,556
I HATE THAT.

1618
01:33:30,387 --> 01:33:31,867
SO, THAT'S IT?

1619
01:33:31,997 --> 01:33:34,696
YOU JUST HATE THE WAY
I WALK AND TALK AND LOOK.

1620
01:33:34,826 --> 01:33:35,784
NO.

1621
01:33:36,915 --> 01:33:39,701
THAT JEDI MIND TRICK THING?

1622
01:33:39,831 --> 01:33:41,528
I HATE THAT.

1623
01:33:41,659 --> 01:33:43,661
DON'T GIVE UP ON ME.

1624
01:33:43,792 --> 01:33:45,054
I'M NOT.

1625
01:33:46,882 --> 01:33:50,929
BUT YOU ARE GONNA REGRET
EVER HAVING MESSED UP.

1626
01:33:51,060 --> 01:33:53,540
'CAUSE I'M GONNA
MAKE YOU PAY FOR A LONG TIME.

1627
01:33:55,412 --> 01:33:56,892
BUT FIRST...

1628
01:33:59,024 --> 01:34:01,810
YOU'RE GOING TO TAKE
THREE STEPS TOWARDS ME.

1629
