♪ WHEN YOU DON'T
HAVE MUCH TO SAY ♪

1634
01:34:22,657 --> 01:34:24,920
♪ THAT'S WHEN I LOVE YOU

1635
01:34:25,050 --> 01:34:26,965
♪ I LOVE YOU

